18:40.880 --> 18:43.189
Oh, wait, wait.
Does Grecian Formula count?

18:43.360 --> 18:44.679
Grecian Formula?

18:44.840 --> 18:46.831
You tried to get gray
out of your pubic hair?

18:47.680 --> 18:49.636
